# CivicAI — Smart City Issue Intelligence
# Environment Configuration Template
# Duplicate this file to .env and provide your credentials.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SUPABASE CONFIGURATION (Backend & Database)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Get these from your Supabase project dashboard -> Settings -> API
# If left blank, CivicAI will run in Local Persistent Demo Mode using browser storage
# with 40+ pre-seeded synthetic civic reports, duplicate detection, and full workflow simulation.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GOOGLE MAPS JAVASCRIPT API (Maps & Places)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Get this from Google Cloud Console -> APIs & Services -> Credentials
# Required APIs to enable on Google Cloud:
# 1. Maps JavaScript API (Required for rendering satellite/street vector map)
# 2. Places API (Optional: for address autocomplete in report submission)
# 3. Geocoding API (Optional: reverse geocoding clicked coordinates to street names)
# NOTE: Restrict this browser key by HTTP Referrer (e.g., http://localhost:5173/*)
# If left blank, CivicAI falls back seamlessly to the interactive OpenStreetMap engine.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTIONAL AI / LLM CONFIGURATION
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional Google Gemini API key for enhanced real-time generative summaries & action briefs.
# When omitted, CivicAI uses its built-in explainable deterministic NLP algorithms,
# priority scoring formulas (0-100), safety risk overrides, and problem-to-solution matrices.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=
